{"id":"gara","lemma":"gara","pos":"noun","rank":1229,"glosses":["competition (the act of competing)","competition; contest; event; race"],"ipa":"/ˈɡa.ra/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"gare"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/33/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-LangPao-gara.wav","examples":[{"text":"Hai vinto la gara?","en":"Did you win the race?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"avere"},{"g":"defeated, beaten"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"È divertente guardare la gara.","en":"It's fun to watch the race.","words":[{"g":"is","l":"essere"},{"g":"funny"},{"g":"to look at"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Vuole partecipare alla gara.","en":"He wants to participate in the contest.","words":[{"g":"to want","l":"volere"},{"g":"to take part in"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Dubito che vincerà entrambe le gare.","en":"I doubt whether he will win both races.","words":[{"g":"to doubt","l":"dubitare"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"to win","l":"vincere"},{"g":"both","l":"entrambi"},{"g":"the / to her"},null]},{"text":"È arrivato quinto alla gara.","en":"He came in fifth in the race.","words":[{"g":"is","l":"essere"},{"g":"successful"},{"g":"fifth"},{"g":"to the"},null]}]}